WEBVTT

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:15.370
Ooh! Nice photo! Thanks!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.660
No problem.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.040
I'm going home.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:22.040
Must be nice to get
picked up all the time.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.460
Thanks, Minato.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.710
Hmm?

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:31.180
Thanks to you, we're the best in Japan.
Thank goodness I'm on your team!

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.760
What the hell--?

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.180
It's true!

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:42.150
Minato! I'll get even better in high
school! We can score as aces together!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.860
Only if you can keep up.
I'll get better, too.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.240
What a team we'll be!

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.690
Right?

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.910
Is this... a dream?

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:01.120
I see... This was right
before the accident...

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.290
Senpai? Minato-<i>senpai</i>?

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.050
Are you okay?

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:12.050
Yeah. It's nothing.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:19.430
They all wanted to copy you and nap.

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.850
And you?

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:30.940
I watched Shogakukan and
Rikka play. It was 23-0.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:36.160
Even without Momo,
it was painfully one-sided.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.240
Rikka Gakuen

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.240
Shogakukan

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.660
I see.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.660
It's finally time.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.330
Yeah.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.330
Before, I only used to be the photo guy.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:51.720
So I'm happy to play against Shogaku
with someone I admire.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.430
Idiot. Be happy after we win.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:58.220
Sorry.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.430
It means nothing... unless we win.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.020
Hey! Get up! Get up!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:09.440
I said nap, not hibernate!

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.990
C'mon, let's get started.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.070
Hurry! Hurry!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.780
You sure he said we can watch?

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:23.660
Episode 12: C'mon, Let's Get Started

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.790
Yup! He said, "Suit yourself!"

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:23.580
Huh?

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.120
That means it's okay!

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.380
Well...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.880
Hurry! It's starting!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:31.880
"Okayama Prefecture's Senior High School"
"Water Polo Tournament"

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.590
We made it!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.140
Good luck.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.970
Th-Thanks.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.600
'Sup?

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.560
'S-Sup?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.020
To think we'd be on different teams...

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.610
Life is full of surprises.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:54.860
Wish I could've faced you in the pool.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.400
I'm game whenever.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.490
You see his muscles?

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.080
Yeah...

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.500
Sorry I couldn't play, Shugo.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.460
It's fine. I'll play my best regardless.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.170
Uh, about going easy on us...

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.260
Hmm?

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.800
Please play with all you've got.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.180
That was the plan.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.350
Quit crying and watch.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.360
But if only I'd played better...!

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:36.240
As our new captain, you've gotta
study our rivals for next year.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.490
Right...

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:42.330
Huh? Aren't you the ball handler, Anna?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.950
Uh, Chinu wanted to do it.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.250
Huh?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:52.840
I've gotta see for myself...
if you've really changed.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.340
Temporarily closed.
We're very sorry 
for any inconvenience.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.470
Yamanami High School

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.470
Shogakukan

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.240
YOSHIHARU

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.130
Good luck, Big Bro!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.130
All right.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.350
First, let's focus on defense.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:50.270
We'll swap Amiami to flat and Buu
to wing with Amiami falling back.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.650
If any opponent gets by, he'll chase them.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:54.480
Got it.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:58.030
Minato, Ei, and Buu will head our attacks.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.400
Mmm.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.740
There he is!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:10.710
It's been a while since
matching up against Koki.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:15.590
I can't move, but...
that doesn't mean I can't score!

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:21.260
So close!

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.800
Shit!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.060
Focus on defense! Focus on defense!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.850
Must defend! Gotta defend!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:39.070
This time, let's not drag the team down...

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.570
Wait!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.860
Hey!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.410
Thanks.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.620
The strategy worked!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.920
How about a taste of my arm?!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.830
Ejection?!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.670
Huh?!

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.420
He purposely stopped to draw the foul!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.130
Ejection?

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:47.680
Let's see... "The player who caused the
foul must stay in the exclusion zone

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:55.270
and cannot play for at least 20 seconds
or until the ball changes possession"?!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.650
What?!

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.400
Defense! Hands up!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.990
Our ball!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.460
Here!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.440
Get back! Stop their counter!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.240
They haven't let down for a second.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.740
I bet they're tired.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.170
We've gotta win!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.380
Yamanami High School

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.380
Shogakukan

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.520
Time's almost up!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:28.990
They're 0-0 against Shogakukan?!
Isn't that, like, awesome?!

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.990
I forgot to breathe.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.370
Mmm!

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.660
Dude, I'm gonna cry!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:40.080
You've cried enough.
Though... I do feel you.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.960
Yeah.

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.710
Let me play, Coach!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.670
No. You're injured.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:49.880
I won't push it!
If it feels wrong, I'll stop!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.060
You see what Koki's doing, don't you?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:03.810
Hot damn! Let's keep this up, guys!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.770
--Yeah!
--Right!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:10.150
They're all so good.
I'm just holding the team back.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.740
You okay?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.240
Huh? Yeah.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.660
I'm feeling good, so just pass it to me.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.500
True, you seem fired up.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.460
--Yeah
--Mmm.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.790
I think it's 'cuz of "that."

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.040
"That"?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.050
Right, Babayaro?

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.510
Oh!

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:31.550
Hey, you got any more of those?

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.470
Huh? Yeah!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.260
He ate one of my chocolates!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.520
Yeah? After turning it down so much?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.730
I thought it might foster teamwork.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.230
You, talking about teamwork?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.860
Shuddap!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.400
I realized something today:

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.240
There're lots of ways to win,
but this team--

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.830
Hey! Look!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.420
Momo-<i>senpai </i>is gonna play!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:10.380
The last boss appears!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.630
At last, I can face him!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.680
Bring it on, Momo!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.890
Yamanami High School

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.890
Shogakukan

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:24.560
I'll beat my brother at swimming!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.700
Finally, I'll win!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:37.200
I'll beat... my brother!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.830
Let's go!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.180
Yamanami High School

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.180
Shogakukan

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:11.780
Quit making those faces!
I'm gonna tie us up!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:38.510
Why? He's nothing like he was earlier!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:47.230
Koki! Quit holding back!

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.650
I'm not!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:53.690
Is that the best you've got?!
Are you even trying to beat Minato?!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:12:01.620
I don't know.
I know he's not like he used to be...

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:09.460
But Minato's weaker than I imagined.
It's like, it's not even fair anymore...

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.420
That's no excuse to hold back!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.500
I know that!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:17.840
It's sad. Minato's finally
back, and yet...

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:23.720
It kinda makes your heart waver.
It keeps you from playing your best.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:31.190
But unless we show him all we've got,
we're not really facing Minato.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.280
Let's go all out!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.450
Get back here!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:44.870
Here!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.620
Yamanami High School

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.620
Shogakukan

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.010
{=3}Yamanami High School

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.010
{=2}Shogakukan

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:17.690
In the 1st, Shogakukan must've been
waiting to see how it went.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:21.660
Now Yamanami is gassed. At this rate...

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.160
At least score one point!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.250
Please! Do it for us!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:36.960
Hey, keep your heads up.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.300
What now? Any plans?

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.800
No, but...!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.140
Minato!

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:52.440
Did you say, "We're a team
that works together" to win?

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.810
Yeah.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.020
I agree!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:55.940
Same!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:56.860
Yeah!

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:57.690
Right!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:58.530
Mmm!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.240
Me, too.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.200
Let's do this together!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.700
--Yeah!
--Right!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:42.820
"Shogakukan" "Yamanami High School"

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:43.990
The final period,
37 seconds left, and it's 15-0...

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:48.160
What are you thinking in a game like this?

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.630
This is bullshit, guys!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:09.550
I'm sick and tired of you holding
me back! Gimme a break!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:16.520
This game is pathetic thanks to you!
Just pass it to me and I'll score!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:21.320
The hell's your problem?
I guess you never changed!

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.400
Huh?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.900
Stop or you'll forfeit the match.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.280
You're all useless.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.250
Well, screw him!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.610
Our ball!

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.680
Beat him!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.340
I've gotta beat him!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.570
Get Minato!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.330
Not yet! It's his feint!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:02.080
Sorry! Not gonna work on me!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:36.580
--Yeah!
--Woo-hoo!
--Hell yeah!

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.040
Yay!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.300
--Yes!
--Yeah!

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:51.380
That was awesome, Ushi!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.590
It's the Ushimado Shout!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.720
Huh?

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:59.600
You told me to shout
for power when I shoot.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:02.390
I see. The other me.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:07.270
Hey, Minato! What's with
your attitude before?!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.440
Sorry. That was to draw defenders.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.280
Tell us first!

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:14.490
That would've given it away.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.990
That's right.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.410
Oh, yeah.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.530
Moron.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.790
Not nice!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.370
Shogakukan

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.370
Yamanami High School

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:28.300
This is a first... Losing but being happy.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:33.550
To think I could feel this happy
without even scoring...

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.560
Good game.

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:40.520
Yeah.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:42.770
You tricked me there.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:43.980
Right?

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.940
Just wait till next time.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:46.860
Yeah!

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:51.480
Dude, that's my line!
You guys showed no mercy.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.490
C'mon! Out of the pool!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.250
--Okay.
--Yeah.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.830
Shugo!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.170
You're really fast.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.760
Right?

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:25.690
Yeah.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.070
So your leg's all right?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.950
Yeah.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.530
Momosaki.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.820
Yes?

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:47.080
You're our team's ace. I've got nothing
but the highest praise for you.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.630
Thanks!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.210
Chinu!

00:19:56.010 --> 00:20:01.100
Can you talk to the first years
who weren't at the meeting? They--

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:03.520
Please do it yourself!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:04.720
Huh?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:09.690
Despite what people think,
I've kinda got my hands full.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:13.070
Can you handle the team on your own?

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:14.990
Uh...

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.410
I've decided to change, too.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.820
Huh?

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.460
How was the competition?

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.380
Ah, runner-up.

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:33.500
Awesome.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.050
No way. Second doesn't go to nationals.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:40.890
How were you?

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:41.590
Huh?

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.430
You play your best?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:45.560
Hmm... I guess?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:47.640
Then, that's awesome.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.860
Yup!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:54.820
Oh, Mom.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.230
Hmm?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.280
I enjoy water polo.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.740
Huh?

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:07.540
I'm playing 'cuz I want to, so...
Don't worry about the accident.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.250
Mmm.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.770
I was so upset, I couldn't sleep!

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:34.900
Right? We got stomped so hard,
we only scored once!

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:36.780
I slept like a rock.

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:37.690
Me, too.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.150
Yeah.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.030
Really?

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:42.450
Anyway, let's beat 'em next time!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.910
--Yeah!
--Right!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.200
For that...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.750
...we need to work on swimming.
I came up with a training program.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.550
What was that smirk?

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:03.550
Amiami getting serious is creepy.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.850
Ugh. My muscles might turn to jam.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.350
Like marmalade.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:11.020
Yeah, yeah!

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.100
Now then!

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.900
You couldn't sleep?

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:16.190
In a way.

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:17.820
Huh?

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:23.610
Was talking with my dad till morning.
We had a lot to catch up on.

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:29.370
Though he wouldn't shut up
when it came to water polo advice.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:36.880
All right! Oh, yeah, Minato...

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:40.420
We did that, so give us a new one.

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:45.720
"Get 1st Win"

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:53.560
If it was you, what would
you write, Minato?

00:22:56.520 --> 00:23:10.740
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight...

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:10.860
Make our team of 7 the best in Japan!
